<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Sorry Kaileigh</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #ffdde1, #ee9ca7);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      text-align: center;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .box {
      max-width: 500px;
      padding: 20px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      border-radius: 15px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .heart {
      font-size: 50px;
      animation: pulse 1s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
      100% { transform: scale(1); }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="box">
    <div class="heart">💔</div>
    <h1>Sorry Kaileigh</h1>

    <p>
      Maraming beses kong pinipindot ang mali,<br>
      pero isang bagay ang totoo…<br><br>

      Nagso-sorry ako sa lahat ng nagawa ko.<br>
      Nanghihingi ako ng forgiveness sayo.<br>
      Ayokong mawala ka sa buhay ko.<br>
      Mahal na mahal kita.
    </p>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
